### soft delete a project

DELETE http://127.0.0.1:8000/projects/e3bb6a61-2c78-4e3b-88ec-a4f771606d12/

### list all assigned projects

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/

### create an assigned project

POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/assigned-projects/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "project": 2,
  "coordinator": 2,
  "developers": [6, 5, 4],
  "project_duration": 6,
  "project_start_date": "2026-11-02",
  "project_tentative_end_date": "2027-01-31"
}

